# The deployed API. Not a secret: it is a public URL the browser is about to request, and
# every key it needs lives on the other side of it, in Secret Manager.
#
# Committed on purpose. Without it a production build falls back to the page's own origin,
# which on Firebase Hosting is a static bucket with no /v1 behind it — so the app would
# come up looking fine and fail on the first recipe search.
VITE_API_URL=https://kitchen-api-667576706709.us-central1.run.app
